  "solution": {
    "brief": "RULE GENERATOR #01\r\nThe RuleGenerator component allows to quickly\r\ngenerate aggregation rules without the need to\r\ntype them one by one.\r\nBy default, the Generator creates rules between\r\neach part and each connection available in the\r\naggregation.\r\nThe SELF_P input allows to decide if a part is allowed\r\nto connect to itself (Must be True for aggregations with\r\nonly one part type).\r\nThe SELF_C input allows to decide if a connection is \r\nallowed to connect to itself.",
